        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: “The Tracy Ullman Show”, “The Simpsons 138th Episode Spectacular”, an early Simpsons short\n- People: Julie Kavner, Matt Groening, Homer Simpson\n- Characters: Homer Simpson, the character named after Matt Groening’s mother\n\nFacts:\n- An early Simpsons short was part of “The Tracy Ullman Show.”\n- That short featured the first appearance of Homer Simpson.\n- That short later aired on “The Simpsons 138th Episode Spectacular.”\n- Matt Groening had a mother whose name was used for a Simpsons character.\n- Julie Kavner voiced the Simpsons character who was named after Matt Groening’s mother.",
