        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "d98c417c-e7cb-577f-864e-fda391077187",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Marge Simpson, Homer Simpson, Julie Kavner, Dan Castellaneta, Margaret Groening, Matt Groening\n- Works: Good Night, The Tracey Ullman Show, The Simpsons 138th Episode Spectacular, The Simpsons Season 1 DVD set\n\nFacts:\n- Marge Simpson first appeared on television in The Tracey Ullman Show short \"Good Night\" on April 19, 1987.\n- Homer Simpson first appeared on television with his family in The Tracey Ullman Show short \"Good Night\" on April 19, 1987.\n- Julie Kavner voices Marge Simpson.\n- Dan Castellaneta voices Homer Simpson.\n- Matt Groening named Marge Simpson after his mother Margaret Groening.\n- \"Good Night\" was later aired in its entirety in The Simpsons 138th Episode Spectacular.\n- \"Good Night\" was included on The Simpsons Season 1 DVD set and is one of the few Ullman shorts released on DVD.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
